  "brain_first": "“一个关键事件拆成2-4个动作：看见→走近→做→反应。”",
  "sort_order": 1065,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2626
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "故事需要连续动作，但学生容易只写情绪或一句带",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2627
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "过。",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2628
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2629
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Action chain：用连续可观察动作推进故事。",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2630
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “一个关键事件拆成2-4个动作：看见→走近→做→反应。”",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2631
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 动作比堆形容词更容易让情节清楚。",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2632
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2633
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 确定这一小段的目标动作。",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2634
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 写触发：人物看到/听到什么。",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2635
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 写核心动作。",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2636
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 写对方或环境反应。",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2637
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5 必要时再加一句情绪。",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2638
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 在空旁标词性 V/N/Adj/Adv；故事题用箭头记情绪/动作，如",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2639
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "worried→help→relieved；难空先打 ? 继续。",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2640
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2641
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· notice → approach → reach out → help",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2642
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· hear → turn → run → find",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2643
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· pause → think → decide → act",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2644
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 每个动作都推动故事，不重复同一意思。",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2645
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 想不到高级词就用 look, walk, run, reach, hold, turn, nod, smile，写准确比",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2646
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "夸张更重要。",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2647
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2648
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I heard a weak cry behind the fence. I stopped, turned back and walked toward the sound. A small",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2649
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "dog was trapped between two boards. I knelt down and carefully pulled them apart.",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2650
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2651
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 一句“Then I helped him”跳过全部过程。",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2652
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 动作太多但没有因果。",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2653
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2654
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 动作顺序能真实发生吗？",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2655
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 每句都推进了吗？",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2656
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： C-P 词性错｜C-X 搭配错｜C-R 复现没发现",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2657
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜C-E 情绪线错｜C-S 故事情节逻辑错。",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2658
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2659
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 动作链：看到/听到 → 接近 → 行动 → 反应。",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2660
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2662
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 动作链“看到→走近→伸手→帮助”比一句“helped him”好在哪？",
      "sourcePage": 99,
      "sourceIndex": 2663
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 动作之间需要什么？",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2664
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 人物突然从房间到街上却无移动描写，问题？",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2665
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 基础续写优先高级动词还是准确动作？",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2666
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 一段连续5句都用He said，怎么改善？",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2667
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 因果和画面更清楚。；2. 时间/因果连接。；3. 动作链断裂。；4. 准确动作。；5. 加入动作/反应，减",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2668
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "少无效对话。",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2669
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— CW2 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“CW2”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2670
    }
  ],
